   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick a file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [anima-base-v1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-base-v1.0.safetensors) | 4.2 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors) | 1.2 GB |\n| `vae/` | [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors) | 0.25 GB |\n| `loras/` | [anima-turbo-lora-v0.2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima-Official-LoRAs/resolve/main/anima-turbo-lora-v0.2.safetensors) | 0.15 GB |\n\nTotal: about 5.8 GB. `qwen_image_vae.safetensors` is the Qwen Image VAE: if you already have it, skip it.\n\nThe Turbo LoRA is needed even with Turbo off: ComfyUI checks that every file named in the graph exists before it runs.\n\n**Optional model swaps** (same repo, pick one in the first loader of group 2; keep Turbo off with the Turbo model):\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [anima-aesthetic-v1.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-aesthetic-v1.1.safetensors) | 4.2 GB |\n| `diffusion_models/` | [anima-turbo-v1.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-turbo-v1.1.safetensors) | 4.2 GB |\n\nBoth were run once at 1024x1024 with the default prompt and seed: Anima Aesthetic v1.1 at 30 steps / CFG 4 (23 s), and Anima Turbo v1.1 with Turbo off, **Steps** 8 and **CFG** 1 (4 s). Anima Aesthetic v1.1 gave a clean picture; the one Anima Turbo v1.1 picture had a white frame (the negative prompt is unused at CFG 1: change the seed). The authors say to leave `score_` tags out of both prompts with the Aesthetic model.\n\n**VRAM:** whole-GPU peak on the 24 GB test card was 6.3 to 7.4 GiB at 1024x1024 and 7.2 GiB (Turbo off) / 9.1 GiB (Turbo on) at 1536x1536, about 0.45 GiB of it held by other programs. That is under 12 GB, but no 12 GB card was used: **not verified on 12 GB**.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3.** Anima support came with ComfyUI 0.11.0 and the Size node with 0.16.0; versions older than 0.45.3 were not tested. **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: Anima is under the CircleStone Labs Non-Commercial License (and NVIDIA's Open Model License, as a Cosmos derivative). You may sell the pictures; you may not run the model as a paid service. Read the model page.\n"
   ]
  },
