   "title": "Why a switch",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Why a switch and not a bypassed LoRA\n\nTurbo needs three changes at once: the LoRA, 8 steps instead of 30, and CFG 1 instead of 4. In the tests, 8 steps at CFG 1 without the LoRA gave a blurred picture, and the LoRA at 30 steps and CFG 4 gave harsh, over-saturated colours. The switches (from the official template) change all three with the one **Turbo** input in group 1, and it works in App mode.\n\nAt CFG 1 the sampler skips the negative prompt: the same Turbo picture came out with two different negative prompts.\n"
   ]
